lass=\"grid-anat-cell\"></span><span class=\"grid-anat-cell\"></span><span class=\"grid-anat-cell\"></span><span class=\"grid-anat-cell\"></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"gap\"><span class=\"grid-anat-gap\"></span></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"container\"><span class=\"grid-anat-box\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"track\"><span class=\"grid-anat-track\"></span></span><span class=\"grid-anat-cell\"></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cell\"><span class=\"grid-anat-cell\">Grid</span></span><span class=\"grid-anat-cell\"></span><span class=\"grid-anat-cell\"></span><span class=\"grid-anat-cell\"></span><span class=\"grid-anat-cell\"></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"gap\"><span class=\"grid-anat-gap\"></span></span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"container","cn":"网格容器","en":"Container","desc":"写上 display: grid 的父元素","desc_en":"Write display: grid on the parent element"},{"key":"track","cn":"轨道","en":"Track","desc":"定义出来的每一行、每一列","desc_en":"Each defined row or column track"},{"key":"cell","cn":"单元格","en":"Cell","desc":"行和列交叉出的格子","desc_en":"The grid formed by the intersection of rows and columns"},{"key":"gap","cn":"网格间距","en":"Gap","desc":"统一设置网格行列之间的间距（gap）","desc_en":"The gaps between grid items, declared once for the whole grid"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"等分列","en":"Repeat","demo":"<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:4px;width:96px\"><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span></div>","demo_en":"<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:4px;width:96px\"><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span></div>","when":"卡片墙每列一样宽","when_en":"Each column of the card wall is the same width"},{"cn":"自适应","en":"AutoFill","demo":"<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(18px,1fr));gap:4px;width:96px\"><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span></div>","demo_en":"<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(18px,1fr));gap:4px;width:96px\"><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span></div>","when":"宽度变了列数自动增减","when_en":"When the width changes, the number of columns automatically increases or decreases."},{"cn":"带间距","en":"Gap","demo":"<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;width:96px\"><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span></div>","demo_en":"<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;width:96px\"><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\"></span></div>","when":"使用 gap 统一管理行列间距","when_en":"Use gap to uniformly manage row and column spacing"},{"cn":"页面骨架","en":"TwoColumns","demo":"<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:4px;width:96px;height:34px\"><span class=\"grid-v\" style=\"height:auto\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\" style=\"height:auto\"></span></div>","demo_en":"<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:4px;width:96px;height:34px\"><span class=\"grid-v\" style=\"height:auto\"></span><span class=\"grid-v\" style=\"height:auto\"></span></div>","when":"侧栏 + 内容这类整体框架","when_en":"Overall framework like sidebar + content"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>卡片墙等分多列</b>：repeat(3, 1fr) 可定义三列等宽轨道","m":"grid-cards"},{"t":"<b>自适应列数</b>：auto-fill 配合 minmax，可按容器宽度和内容最小宽度换列","m":"grid-autofill"},{"t":"<b>页面骨架</b>：用列轨道明确侧栏与主要内容的宽度关系","m":"grid-layout"},{"t":"<b>使用 gap 管理格距</b>，避免逐个给网格项设置 {c:margin}","m":"grid-gap"}],"dont":[{"t":"只排<b>一行或一列</b>时，{c:flex} 通常更简单","m":"flex-vs-grid"},{"t":"手写 <b>width: 33.33%</b> 建栅格：调整间距时需要额外计算","m":"grid-percent","bad":true},{"t":"固定列数与列宽可能在<b>窄屏发生溢出</b>，应按内容与断点调整或使用自适应列","m":"grid-fixed","bad":true},{"t":"逐项使用 {c:margin} 制造格距，会增加<b>边缘项目的单独处理</b>","m":"grid-margin","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"模板库要把同类卡片排成多行多列，并根据容器宽度自动减少列数。怎样实现更合适？","options":[{"id":"fixed-card-widths","label":"给每张卡片固定宽度和左边距，逐项计算换行位置","feedback":"逐项计算会把布局绑在当前数量和宽度上，容器变化时容易出现空洞或溢出。","correct":false},{"id":"responsive-grid","label":"父级使用 Grid，以 minmax 定义可换列的轨道","feedback":"任务同时涉及行和列；网格轨道能统一管理列宽、间距，并按可用空间重新排布。","correct":true},{"id":"fixed-flex-columns","label":"用 Flex 换行，并把每张卡固定为 33.33% 宽","feedback":"Flex 可以换行，但固定三等分还要额外计算间距和窄屏列数，二维轨道更直接。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A template library needs multiple rows and columns of similar cards, with fewer columns as the container narrows. Which implementation fits?","options":[{"id":"fixed-card-widths","label":"Give each card a fixed width and margin and calculate every wrap point","feedback":"Manual calculations bind the layout to the current count and width, causing gaps or overflow when the container changes.","correct":false},{"id":"responsive-grid","label":"Use Grid on the parent and define responsive tracks with minmax","feedback":"The task coordinates rows and columns. Grid tracks manage width, gaps, and rearrangement from the available space.","correct":true},{"id":"fixed-flex-columns","label":"Wrap with Flex and fix every card at 33.33% width","feedback":"Flex can wrap, but fixed thirds still require gap calculations and separate rules for narrower column counts.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把模板卡片改为响应式 Grid，用内容可读的最小宽度和 minmax 自动换列，统一使用 gap。不要把卡片固定成三等分。请检查宽屏、平板和手机下没有溢出，卡片操作仍然可见。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Turn the template cards into a responsive Grid using a readable minimum width, minmax, and a shared gap. Do not fix cards to three equal columns. Verify wide, tablet, and mobile widths for overflow and visible card actions."}},"references":[{"title":"CSS Grid 网格布局","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/CSS_layout/Grids","title_en":"CSS grid layout"},{"title":"CSS Grid 布局完整指南","source":"CSS-Tricks","url":"https://css-tricks.com/snippets/css/complete-guide-grid/","title_en":"A Complete Guide to CSS Grid Layout"}],"scenes":["图片卡片墙","响应式商品列表","仪表盘格子","页面整体骨架"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Responsive card gallery","m":"grid-cards"},{"t":"Dashboard panels","m":"grid-autofill"},{"t":"Page regions with aligned rows and columns","m":"grid-layout"},{"t":"Layouts with intentional spanning","m":"grid-gap"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use grid for a simple one-dimensional row","m":"flex-vs-grid"},{"t":"Hard-code many columns on small screens","m":"grid-percent","bad":true},{"t":"Reorder content visually in a way that breaks reading order","m":"grid-fixed","bad":true},{"t":"Create empty tracks only to imitate spacing","m":"grid-margin","bad":true}],"scenes":["Card gallery","Dashboard","Media grid","Page shell"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"position:relative;padding-top:12px\">\n      <span class=\"grid-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0\">repeat(3, 1fr) three equal columns</span>\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px\">\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/cover-mountain.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:52px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px\">Mountain Hiking</b><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">1.2k Collection</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/cover-workspace.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:52px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:6px 8px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px\">Desktop aesthetics</b><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">856 Collection</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--bord